WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.695
This is Qalam: a free phonetic Arabic keyboard for Mac and Windows.

2
00:00:05.695 --> 00:00:08.588
You type Arabic the way you spell it.

3
00:00:09.588 --> 00:00:14.051
After you install it, a short setup walks you through everything.

4
00:00:14.051 --> 00:00:19.501
It turns the keyboard on, then lets you pick your style, harakat and sukūn.

5
00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:28.037
To switch between English and Arabic, press Control-Space on a Mac, or Ctrl+Alt+A on Windows.

6
00:00:29.037 --> 00:00:31.192
Type each letter, then its vowel.

7
00:00:31.192 --> 00:00:36.521
Sukūn and shadda appear by themselves: double a letter, and you get a shadda.

8
00:00:37.521 --> 00:00:41.978
Letters with no English match get simple keys.

9
00:00:41.978 --> 00:00:44.110
A lowercase e is ʿayn.

10
00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:48.664
Capital H, S, D, T and Z are the heavy letters.

11
00:00:48.664 --> 00:00:52.443
th, dh, kh and gh work as you'd expect.

12
00:00:52.443 --> 00:00:57.491
t' is tāʾ marbūṭa, and capital Y is alif maqṣūra.

13
00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:01.848
For a hamza, type a capital A followed by its vowel.

14
00:01:01.848 --> 00:01:04.407
Qalam picks the right seat for you.

15
00:01:05.407 --> 00:01:13.675
Long phrases work too: the article, sun letters, and in Qur'an style every mark of the mushaf.

16
00:01:14.675 --> 00:01:17.712
As you type, Qalam offers other spellings.

17
00:01:17.712 --> 00:01:21.845
Use the arrow keys to choose, and Space to put it in.

18
00:01:22.845 --> 00:01:26.730
Sukūn is smart: it only appears where it's needed.

19
00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:31.782
Control-Shift-O on a Mac, or Ctrl+Alt+O on Windows, turns it off.

20
00:01:31.782 --> 00:01:35.501
The Harakat button removes every vowel mark.

21
00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:41.424
Every shortcut can be changed in Settings, in case it clashes with another app.

22
00:01:42.424 --> 00:01:44.240
Where are the settings?

23
00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:48.108
On a Mac, click ق in the menu bar and open Qalam.

24
00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:53.618
On Windows, right-click the tray icon and choose Setup & settings.

25
00:01:54.618 --> 00:01:59.411
In Settings you can choose the Arabic font and its size, including a Qur'an font.

26
00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:02.419
Qalam keeps itself up to date.

27
00:02:02.419 --> 00:02:08.678
To check now: Settings → Updates on a Mac, or Check for updates in the Windows tray menu.

28
00:02:09.678 --> 00:02:14.309
Qalam is free, works offline, and never sends your typing anywhere.

29
00:02:14.309 --> 00:02:16.613
Download it from our website.
